              "description": "Identifies `kintsua watch snapshot --push` and `kintsua watch diff --push`, which send the captured tool schemas to a hosted Kintsua service authenticated by an SDK key. exec and xargs launches are blocked by Guard's wrapper floor.",
              "example_command": "kintsua watch diff --server https://mcp.vendor.com/mcp --name vendor --push --repo acme/agent",
